who "},{"t":"em","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"need"}]},{"t":"#text","x":" visibility but don’t have the time, strategy, or consistency to do it themselves."}]},{"t":"p","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"Here are "},{"t":"strong","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"14 types of clients"}]},{"t":"#text","x":" who will happily pay for your content creation expertise 👇"}]},{"t":"hr","a":{"contenteditable":"false"}},{"t":"h2","a":{"id":"a92b1bca-d6ca-44cc-95a8-7941196dc908","data-toc-id":"a92b1bca-d6ca-44cc-95a8-7941196dc908","style":"font-weight: 600; text-align: left; font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.2;"},"ch":[{"t":"strong","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"💼 1. High-Profile Executives"}]}]},{"t":"p","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"Directors, founders, and C-suite leaders need to look good online — professionally "},{"t":"em","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"and"}]},{"t":"#text","x":" personally."},{"t":"br"},{"t":"#text","x":"You’ll help them position their brand on platforms like "},{"t":"strong","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"LinkedIn"}]},{"t":"#text","x":", shaping content that attracts partnerships, board invitations, and opportunities."}]},{"t":"p","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"💡 "},{"t":"em","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"Goal:"}]},{"t":"#text","x":" Build credibility, visibility, and professional influence."}]},{"t":"hr","a":{"contenteditable":"false"}},{"t":"h2","a":{"id":"bbcebc0b-3187-42b1-8f9e-8258f770f276","data-toc-id":"bbcebc0b-3187-42b1-8f9e-8258f770f276","style":"font-weight: 600; text-align: left; font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.2;"},"ch":[{"t":"strong","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"🗳️ 2. Politicians"}]}]},{"t":"p","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"Politics is a numbers game."},{"t":"br"},{"t":"#text","x":"Politicians need visibility, reputation management, and campaign storytelling. You’ll create posts, speeches, and digital content that connects them to voters."}]},{"t":"p","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"💰 "},{"t":"em","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"Pro tip:"}]},{"t":"#text","x":" Election season = high-paying contracts."},{"t":"br"},{"t":"#text","x":"("},{"t":"em","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"Just don’t fight with your conscience if the client is… questionable. 😅"}]},{"t":"#text","x":")"}]},{"t":"hr","a":{"contenteditable":"false"}},{"t":"h2","a":{"id":"e9459dcd-0d3d-40a3-96ee-e9c1c0db1ba8","data-toc-id":"e9459dcd-0d3d-40a3-96ee-e9c1c0db1ba8","style":"font-weight: 600; text-align: left; font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.2;"},"ch":[{"t":"strong","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"⛪ 3. Pastors & Faith Leaders"}]}]},{"t":"p","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"Pastors produce tons of content — every sermon is a message waiting to be repurposed."},{"t":"br"},{"t":"#text","x":"You’ll turn audio into posts, sermons into quotes, and teachings into digital devotionals."}]},{"t":"p","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"💡 "},{"t":"em","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"Goal:"}]},{"t":"#text","x":" Spread the message wider and attract more followers to the ministry."}]},{"t":"hr","a":{"contenteditable":"false"}},{"t":"h2","a":{"id":"56c038a4-c311-46ab-a2d7-ff6d45bc3d05","data-toc-id":"56c038a4-c311-46ab-a2d7-ff6d45bc3d05","style":"font-weight: 600; text-align: left; font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.2;"},"ch":[{"t":"strong","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"🎤 4. Musical Artists"}]}]},{"t":"p","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"Streaming made the music industry digital-first. Artists need a personal brand that keeps fans engaged between releases."}]},{"t":"p","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"🎧 "},{"t":"em","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"You’ll help them:"}]},{"t":"#text","x":" Grow followers, stay consistent, and monetize their visibility."}]},{"t":"hr","a":{"contenteditable":"false"}},{"t":"h2","a":{"id":"8c3b7b34-cab5-42e8-b187-e1651a3a507c","data-toc-id":"8c3b7b34-cab5-42e8-b187-e1651a3a507c","style":"font-weight: 600; text-align: left; font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.2;"},"ch":[{"t":"strong","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"⚽ 5. Athletes"}]}]},{"t":"p","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"Talent opens the door. Branding keeps it open."},{"t":"br"},{"t":"#text","x":"You’ll help athletes connect with fans, showcase achievements, and attract sponsorships or international contracts."}]},{"t":"p","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"💪🏾 "},{"t":"em","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"Goal:"}]},{"t":"#text","x":" Build a brand that travels beyond the field."}]},{"t":"hr","a":{"contenteditable":"false"}},{"t":"h2","a":{"id":"682af9d0-6554-45d4-8693-117c1b628da4","data-toc-id":"682af9d0-6554-45d4-8693-117c1b628da4","style":"font-weight: 600; text-align: left; font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.2;"},"ch":[{"t":"strong","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"🎬 6. Models, Actors & Actresses"}]}]},{"t":"p","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"Two equally talented people, but one has 100K followers — who do you think gets the call-back?"},{"t":"br"},{"t":"#text","x":"That’s right — visibility sells. You’ll manage their profiles, photos, and audience engagement strategy."}]},{"t":"p","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"💡 "},{"t":"em","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"Goal:"}]},{"t":"#text","x":" Build digital influence that increases casting opportunities."}]},{"t":"hr","a":{"contenteditable":"false"}},{"t":"h2","a":{"id":"ffac4973-e799-450e-9725-2b9a6d0531ad","data-toc-id":"ffac4973-e799-450e-9725-2b9a6d0531ad","style":"font-weight: 600; text-align: left; font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.2;"},"ch":[{"t":"strong","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"🧭 7. Consultants"}]}]},{"t":"p","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"Consultants "},{"t":"em","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"are"}]},{"t":"#text","x":" their brand."},{"t":"br"},{"t":"#text","x":"You’ll help them communicate their expertise through case studies, educational posts, and authority-building content that makes clients say, “This is the person I need.”"}]},{"t":"hr","a":{"contenteditable":"false"}},{"t":"h2","a":{"id":"e394cc95-d59d-4638-9d32-d8b396e7df69","data-toc-id":"e394cc95-d59d-4638-9d32-d8b396e7df69","style":"font-weight: 600; text-align: left; font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.2;"},"ch":[{"t":"strong","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"🧘🏽‍♀️ 8. Coaches & Therapists"}]}]},{"t":"p","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"These are your transformation storytellers."},{"t":"br"},{"t":"#text","x":"You’ll help them share success stories, build community, and translate their “deep work” into relatable content."}]},{"t":"p","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"💬 "},{"t":"em","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"Favorite category alert:"}]},{"t":"#text","x":" Spiritually gifted coaches thrive when their content finally matches their calling."}]},{"t":"hr","a":{"contenteditable":"false"}},{"t":"h2","a":{"id":"a101be11-1873-4f53-85ad-ce263c19e63c","data-toc-id":"a101be11-1873-4f53-85ad-ce263c19e63c","style":"font-weight: 600; text-align: left; font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.2;"},"ch":[{"t":"strong","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"📚 9. Authors"}]}]},{"t":"p","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"If someone’s written a book (or three), they need content that sells their ideas — not just their books."},{"t":"br"},{"t":"#text","x":"You’ll help them plan launches, repurpose chapters into posts, and run book campaigns."}]},{"t":"p","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"💡 "},{"t":"em","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"Goal:"}]},{"t":"#text","x":" Sell books, build thought leadership, grow speaking invitations."}]},{"t":"hr","a":{"contenteditable":"false"}},{"t":"h2","a":{"id":"2714b6f3-7aeb-43f5-8123-0bb2d6cb91b8","data-toc-id":"2714b6f3-7aeb-43f5-8123-0bb2d6cb91b8","style":"font-weight: 600; text-align: left; font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.2;"},"ch":[{"t":"strong","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"🎓 10. Course Creators"}]}]},{"t":"p","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"They know how to teach — but not always how to "},{"t":"em","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"market."}]},{"t":"br"},{"t":"#text","x":"You’ll help them build trust, show results, and attract new students through storytelling, testimonials, and visuals."}]},{"t":"hr","a":{"contenteditable":"false"}},{"t":"h2","a":{"id":"8c240e47-f26d-489c-8414-7bd2f141961b","data-toc-id":"8c240e47-f26d-489c-8414-7bd2f141961b","style":"font-weight: 600; text-align: left; font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.2;"},"ch":[{"t":"strong","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"🎙️ 11. Speakers"}]}]},{"t":"p","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"Event organizers stalk social media before they book anyone."},{"t":"br"},{"t":"#text","x":"Your job: make your client look confident, credible, and stage-ready."},{"t":"br"},{"t":"#text","x":"Their online presence becomes their portfolio."}]},{"t":"p","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"💡 "},{"t":"em","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"Fun fact:"}]},{"t":"#text","x":" I get most of my own speaking invitations because of how my content positions me online."}]},{"t":"hr","a":{"contenteditable":"false"}},{"t":"h2","a":{"id":"383b44aa-78c1-41a5-be1b-00283bbc8e70","data-toc-id":"383b44aa-78c1-41a5-be1b-00283bbc8e70","style":"font-weight: 600; text-align: left; font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.2;"},"ch":[{"t":"strong","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"👔 12. Business Owners"}]}]},{"t":"p","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"Many CEOs know they "},{"t":"em","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"should"}]},{"t":"#text","x":" post, but they’re too busy running the company."},{"t":"br"},{"t":"#text","x":"You’ll help them show the "},{"t":"em","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"human side"}]},{"t":"#text","x":" of leadership — team culture, brand story, and thought leadership posts."}]},{"t":"p","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"💰 "},{"t":"em","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"Goal:"}]},{"t":"#text","x":" Drive brand trust and organic reach."}]},{"t":"hr","a":{"contenteditable":"false"}},{"t":"h2","a":{"id":"21fa681f-e613-4957-a536-a68b4688afe1","data-toc-id":"21fa681f-e613-4957-a536-a68b4688afe1","style":"font-weight: 600; text-align: left; font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.2;"},"ch":[{"t":"strong","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"❤️ 13. Nonprofit Professionals"}]}]},{"t":"p","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"These clients have big hearts but small marketing budgets."},{"t":"br"},{"t":"#text","x":"You’ll help them build authentic visibility that attracts donors, volunteers, and partners."}]},{"t":"p","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"💡 "},{"t":"em","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"Goal:"}]},{"t":"#text","x":" Use storytelling to inspire trust and social impact."}]},{"t":"hr","a":{"contenteditable":"false"}},{"t